/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
51.0236220472441033 623.6222834645668627 Td
(This disconnect creates tangible business consequences: reduced efficiency and productivity, as managers lack) Tj
T* (visibility into what team members are doing on a day-to-day basis, preventing them from targeting actions to) Tj
T* (improve ways of working. These visibility gaps manifest in measurable operational impacts including increased) Tj
T* (costs, low productivity, low quality outputs, missed SLAs, project delays, and deteriorating business KPIs. A) Tj
T* (diagnostic tool capturing dual perspectives \(manager and member lens\) across back, middle, and front office) Tj
T* (functions would surface authentic insights and enable organisations to address these hidden performance gaps.) Tj
T* (The tool will allow organisations to upload existing survey responses and other datasets alongside the) Tj
T* (diagnostic assessment, providing additional context and enabling deeper analysis of candour patterns and their) Tj
T* (measurable impact on operational performance, whilst helping quantify the business consequences of visibility) Tj
T* (gaps across key metrics.) Tj
